OL,4,G0350FWitness History
OL,5,     GIn 1980, Cuban President Fidel
OL,6,     GCastro opened the port of Mariel
OL,7,     Gto anyone who wanted to leave.
OL,8,     GMirta Ojito was one of more than
OL,9,     G100,000 Cubans who departed for
OL,10,     Gthe US.
